 "purpose": "Q-ATTN-RATE 2026-10-16: PV16 V port of the KV die (16 per die, ONE master). Replaces the 8-sector double-buffered transposer: with the VMAP=1 V placement each w16 port reads only groups {lane,0}/{lane,1}, every PC streams in the controller's v_consumer_order; the port is a static 2:1 quad select with input + output pin registers and tag checks.",
 "job": {
